            "description": {
              "value": "For a short time, you fully manifest the expectations of the god destroyer within you. All creatures within a 10-foot emanation take 8d6 force damage with a basic Fortitude save. A creature that fails this save is also knocked prone. For 1 minute, any creature who ends its turn within the 10-foot emanation takes 5d6 force damage with a basic Fortitude save. If you aren't drained, you can choose to become drained 2 when you use Dominion Aura to increase the radius of the emanation from 10 feet to 20 feet."
